 we can of an  undergraduate experience for them and i  think  for them i mean  uh ypi is just a great um way to get  around the sort of hyper organization of  the prison  and think very openly and collectively  about  various political and intellectual um  things they've been thinking about um  yeah and like the students come from all  sort of  regions of the prison as well so there's  that sort of like larger spatial  divisions that we we also have to think  about as well  [Music]  yeah um there  there definitely is i think zelda could  speak more to it um zelda's in the  audience right there she's the director  of the program but  thank you everyone  [Applause]  [Music]  you
 

